# OmegaOS — Clerk app pool (clerk-pool.env)
# =============================================================================
# Used only when CLERK_PROVISION_MODE="pool" in services.env.
#
# Clerk has no public app-creation API, so you pre-create a stock of Clerk
# applications in the dashboard (https://dashboard.clerk.com) and paste their
# keys here, ONE app per line. /omega-new-project pops the first UNUSED line,
# wires its keys into the new project, and marks it used (prepends `# USED `).
#
# Location at runtime : ~/.omega/provisioning/clerk-pool.env   (chmod 600)
# Gitignored via ~/.omega/. Refill whenever it runs low.
#
# Format (pipe-separated):
#   <publishable_key>|<secret_key>|<label>
# Example:
#   pk_test_xxx|sk_test_xxx|spare-app-1
# =============================================================================
